cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastcircuit in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "fastcircuit: compiled circuit building for Qiskit"
abstract: >-
  fastcircuit compiles the Python code that builds Qiskit circuits, loops
  included, to native code that appends gates through Qiskit's C API.
